### Login as admin first
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "iamadmin"
}

###

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3001/api/admin/users

###

### Promote a user to admin (replace 2 with a real user_id from the list above)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/admin/users/2/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### Demote back to user
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/admin/users/2/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "user"
}

###

### Delete a user (replace 2 with a real user_id - careful on shared db)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/admin/users/2